3. Update on WCST Products
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Well, there's not really much to say here.  We're working on the next version
of the Spoilers (obviously).  One change in the next version of the Spoilers
is that it will have little boxed tidbits of information scattered
throughout.  For instance, did you know that if you're playing Nethack
between 12:00 am and 12:59 am, all undead monsters that hit will give you
twice as many damage dice as normal?  (I.E., if it would normally do 2d4
damage to you, it will do 4d4 instead.)  Nasty, huh?

We also have several other projects in the works, including a Nethack
Bestiary with completely original illustrations, and a new Nethack Data file,
which will give complete information on any monster from within the game.

Oh - one more update on a WCST Product.  (A little shameless advertising
never hurt anybody, eh?)  We're still selling the commercial version of the
Spoilers.  It has all of the information in the public version and more, with
illustrations, a complete index, and cheat sheets.  It's all printed on a
high quality laser printer, and spiral bound.  Its front cover is even clear
plastic, so it won't get utterly ruined if you spill coffee on the front of
it in those late night Nethack sessions!  We've sold copies to people as far
away as Japan and Australia.  Send e-mail if you'd like more information.

